     "titulo": "Comparing without exaggerating",
     "texto": [
      "Use **varmere/kaldere enn gjennomsnittet** («warmer/colder than average») to compare a reading with an average, and **kan føre til** («can lead to») to mark a possible consequence. Distinguish a local measurement from a long-term trend; a single observation alone does not prove climate change."
